{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1722.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"1806560ae176eb128ff3bd66347beac592cb648efc01980c5a54e1bcaafc6f2b","ja":"これも正夢？","zh":"这也是预知梦？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1722.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"17819357d84c7f5490c2838dc6355930091b3bec29c726ef9ccdfa27407bbad6","ja":"夢の中で、私は大きな鳥籠に入って、\nPV撮影をしていたのですが……。","zh":"在梦里，我进到了一个巨大的鸟笼中，\n正在拍摄PV……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1722.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"891648892d61618d9092caf4a43e11068cdd2d642bc6a3cfd1db615aaa5b6e4b","ja":"撮影、お疲れ様でした……えっ、鍵が……！？\nあの、鳥籠から出られないのですが……。","zh":"拍摄辛苦了……咦，锁……！？\n那个，我好像出不去鸟笼了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1722.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"e63d32414e643ffcbb093a992a9a434c86e38c0c2403be32a8096ed7356492a0","ja":"それに真っ暗で……。\n誰か……誰もいない？　どうして？","zh":"而且眼前一片漆黑……。\n有人吗……谁都不在？为什么？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1722.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"d8479c129c1690deabd3fd6a8d747f9ae20e07bec7f7176327da21fc31e64bd8","ja":"なんと面妖な。\n恐ろしい思いをしたのですね。","zh":"何等怪异。\n想必经历了一番可怕的遭遇吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1722.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"275a662414bde65a4f8dac5289b7179841a708598897234694369eb109d19c93","ja":"はい……。\nただその後、みんなが助けに来てくれたんです。","zh":"是的……。\n不过在那之后，大家都来帮我了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1722.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"bca7153ffea1718ac9bcb0ddd46819ad4dc2806f4169c86e25abccd714279dba","ja":"チハヤ！\n今すぐ助けます！　待っていてください！","zh":"千早！\n我马上来救你！请等我！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1722.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"a8d331c1c4efeb13075a6b5d58554b62f90f58a4a0ff2357a159ff6f9b0c9f77","ja":"使えそうな道具を持ってきました！\nこれで鍵を壊せば……！","zh":"我带了好像能派上用场的工具过来！\n只要用这个把锁砸坏的话……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1722.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"627c777a148004bdb8e965cd25449cda75d883bcd85847c0a17553fdad02b640","ja":"……扉があきましたわ！　さあこちらに！\nひとりでよく耐えましたわね。もう大丈夫ですわ。","zh":"……门开了！快到这边来！\n你一个人坚持得很好呢。已经没事了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1722.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"acaa4f8febdf2155915cedb974bd2d8bcbefca9694ecf74ce95ea98b0f1d06f7","ja":"みんなのおかげで、あの夢も怖くなくなりました……。\nありがとうございます。","zh":"多亏了大家，那个梦我也不再害怕了……\n非常感谢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1722.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"07596a43b78fe9d312d116b3049269945cb5c2acdecc4edca272a8fe909d1ca5","ja":"ふふ。それではみなさん、今日はこのあたりで。\nみちこ、締めの挨拶を……おや？","zh":"呵呵。那么各位，今天就先到这里吧。\n路子，来做最后的致辞……哎呀？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1722.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"334d7f0915f7c5cd366b0fb278979253d744e1e643b2d7f6e5bca299d43270a7","ja":"と、トラブルです！\nレッスンルームのドアがあきません！","zh":"出、出状况了！\n练习室的门打不开了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1722.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"e7c88ed8c56560c60306a18ffa14535c815a7f511cefbe4be1add4064198773b","ja":"スマホは控え室に置いてきたから、\n連絡も取れません～！","zh":"手机落在休息室了，\n根本没法联系啊～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1722.unity3d","item_key":"commands[54].text","source_sha256":"e1d18594a7378b2bc8a7fd0c3aed286bf0e74c0c7b593ec910737cd5d3c3b7a1","ja":"そんな……千早の戦具『青い鳥籠』が\n発動したみたいですわね。","zh":"怎么会……看来是千早的战具『青鸟之笼』\n发动了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1722.unity3d","item_key":"commands[55].text","source_sha256":"b21132bb7c919069aa5edb43b187499c084dc64e9c8ce8ee3d63125ed2cf4b02","ja":"千早の夢も、正夢だったのでしょうか？\nそれなら、助けが来るのでは……。","zh":"千早的梦，也是预知梦吗？\n如果是那样，是不是就会有人来救援了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1722.unity3d","item_key":"commands[56].text","source_sha256":"efc62df5a2026c94b1a707712bab46c39949b8f49d66c7b0a49687fb554521e0","ja":"あ！　もしかしたら、近くに\n●●●●プロデューサーがいるかもしれません！","zh":"啊！说不定附近\n有●●●●制作人呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1722.unity3d","item_key":"commands[57].text","source_sha256":"7b46ee042734a2e42049389d4b1135a2271dee79537fa3f800e089e84d5b8ec7","ja":"いますか、●●●●プロデューサー！\nドアを開けてくださ～い！","zh":"在吗，●●●●制作人！\n快开门呀～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1722.unity3d","item_key":"commands[66].text","source_sha256":"3b42685eb77af864d92808cb20195fa3879a8ffc4983a9677fd464875ab15dad","ja":"まさか、大きな荷物が倒れて引っかかっていたとは。\nそれでは改めまして、えんでぃんぐです。","zh":"真没想到，竟然是大件行李倒下来卡住了。\n那么重新来过，进入尾声环节。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1722.unity3d","item_key":"commands[67].text","source_sha256":"aaa41c6b24500425a402433970ab64049d22a0ec60cb9502b1e3685474d4d6d3","ja":"ラストは、ロコが\n戦具『キャプションペン』を使います～！","zh":"最后，由ROCO\n使用战具“说明笔”～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1722.unity3d","item_key":"commands[68].text","source_sha256":"773a4fe48a788202bc97d5d33ac114040fd66e36b3d6726ac2ef765e5a5ffa79","ja":"いきますよ～……\n『ドラマの本編も、みんな楽しんでね♪』","zh":"要上咯～……\n“大家也要好好享受电视剧正片哦♪”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
